    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the high-speed world of <strong>&quot;Agent&quot;</strong> \u2013 a relentless 2D platformer designed for adrenaline-fueled speedrunning. As &quot;Agent,&quot; you'll charge through intense, action-packed levels, overcoming fierce enemies and navigating high-stakes obstacles at lightning speed. Each of the 20 levels climaxes in an epic boss battle, where victory is the only path forward. Every boss brings a new layer of challenge, demanding skill, strategy, and quick reflexes to subvert and conquer.</p>",
